# Meson subproject archives, resolved by meson rather than by extract_source.
#
# A meson project declares optional dependencies as wrap files and downloads them at
# configure time when the dependency is not already present. Almost every wrap in
# these tarballs resolves against a library this bundle now vendors itself, so it is
# never fetched -- but cairo ships no subproject sources at all and genuinely needs
# fontconfig is built from source like everything else here as of 3.7.1. It used to be
# left to cairo's meson subproject, which only triggers when the container's own copy
# is too old for cairo -- and Debian 11's 2.13.1 is not, so nothing was ever built and
# cairo and libXft linked the host's instead. pango wants >= 2.15.0 and falls back to a
# git clone, which an offline build cannot serve at all.
fontconfig-${FONTCONFIG_VERSION}.tar.xz|https://www.freedesktop.org/software/fontconfig/release/fontconfig-${FONTCONFIG_VERSION}.tar.xz

# wayland and wayland-protocols. freedesktop retired wayland.freedesktop.org/releases for
# these, so the GitLab release download is the origin rather than a mirror of one.
wayland-${WAYLAND_VERSION}.tar.xz|https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland/-/releases/${WAYLAND_VERSION}/downloads/wayland-${WAYLAND_VERSION}.tar.xz
wayland-protocols-${WAYLAND_PROTOCOLS_VERSION}.tar.xz|https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland-protocols/-/releases/${WAYLAND_PROTOCOLS_VERSION}/downloads/wayland-protocols-${WAYLAND_PROTOCOLS_VERSION}.tar.xz
